<title>UK: OPEC basket price slipped to $22.37 on Friday.</title>
<headline>OPEC basket price slipped to $22.37 on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The price of OPEC's basket of seven crudes stood at $22.37 per barrel on Friday, against $22.46 the previous day, according to the OPEC Secretariat's calculations, the OPEC news agency said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7630</p>
